        complexity: { best: 'B-N+1 equations, fewer than node analysis in series-heavy circuits', avg: 'the coefficient matrix is symmetric for reciprocal networks', worst: 'non-planar circuits have no meshes and the method does not apply', note: 'Symmetry of the matrix is lost as soon as a dependent source is present, which is a useful check.' },
