        complexity: { best: 'a relaxed circuit needs no pre-switching analysis at all', avg: 'two resistive analyses plus one continuity step', worst: 'multiple storage elements require every one to be tracked separately', note: 'The commonest slip is forgetting that the switch position differs between the first and second circuits.' },
