        complexity: { best: 'one division gives the settling time estimate', avg: 'the 5 tau rule is accurate to better than 1 percent', worst: 'circuits with two widely separated time constants settle in stages and the single-tau rule misleads', note: 'For second-order circuits, settling is governed by the slower of the two time constants.' },
